{
  "_doc": "Tier-3 farmhouse at the head of Larch Hollow (framework farm_okafor, lot 'house', front faces the yard). Route: porch - front door and windows boarded over -> round the east side to the smashed parlour window -> parlour under the fallen bathroom: Papa's shell box and the store-room key (the rubble stirs) -> front hall, stairs up -> landing (creaky boards), Ife's room (journal), Chidi's room (her letter; the floor is weak over the parlour) -> spare room under the leaking roof: the floor gives into Papa's nailed-up room -> his bed shoved off the boards he clawed open -> drop into the root cellar (ambush: Papa and the others wake) -> padlocked cold room (shotgun on the door): Papa's strongbox, Ife's note -> up the ladder through the hatch into the bolted pantry -> draw the bolt (shortcut) -> kitchen -> out the back door. The summer kitchen ell (one storey, off the east end, its own door to the yard) is a side room: its door into Papa's room is nailed shut too. The kitchen's back door is open from the start but the pantry is bolted and the dining-room door piled shut: a dead end. Cellar terrain holes: docs/POI_AUTHORING.md 'Cellars and terrain'.",
  "defs": [
    {
      "id": "okafor_farmhouse",
      "name": "The Okafor Farmhouse",
